          "sourceFilename": "453_minimum_moves_to_equal_array_elements.rs",
          "code": "impl Solution {\n    pub fn min_moves(nums: Vec<i32>) -> i32 {\n        let (sum, min) = nums\n            .iter()\n            .fold((0, nums[0]), |(sum, min), &x| (sum + x, min.min(x)));\n        sum - (min * nums.len() as i32)\n    }\n}\n\nstruct Solution {}\n",
