          "rawCommitSubject": "rust 453: invariant trick",
          "commitBody": "increasing everything except 1 item by 1 is the same as decreasing 1\nitem by 1.\n\nthe number of moves to decrease everything to 0 is the sum. Then we\nbackstop it at decreasing everything to the lowest number",
